SDP81_Band6_CalibratedData.tgz contains the calibrated uv-data:

* SDP81_band6_9exec.ms.calavg
* SDP81_band6_9exec.ms.co87
* SDP81_band6_9exec.ms.h2o

To produce these calibrated datasets you will need to execute the calibration
scripts in SDP81_Band6_CalibrationScripts.tgz and follow the imaging script
that is located at the CASA guide page listed above.

SDP81_band6_11exec.ms.calavg is the spectrally averaged continuum calibrated dataset.
SDP81_band6_9exec.ms.co87 and SDP81_band6_9exec.ms.h2o are the higher spectral resolution
calibrated datasets that contain the H2O and CO J=8-7 lines.


SDP81_Band6_ReferenceImages.tgz contains the line and continuum image products:

